      "Gluten-free, with the widest range of shapes",
      "Buyers say it holds shape well in bakes and salads",
      "About 11 g protein and 5 g fiber per 2 oz, roughly 1.5x regular pasta",
      "Easy to find on Amazon and in most supermarkets"
