          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Where should I buy protein pasta on Amazon?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Buy from listings marked Ships from and sold by Amazon, or from the brand's own storefront, and compare the price per ounce rather than per pack. Multipacks and Subscribe & Save usually give the best price, but some third-party listings charge far more or ship fewer boxes than shown. Check the photographed Nutrition Facts panel before ordering."
